  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "Remains of a quarried ancient settlement of Roman date, recorded by Gsell (AAA, whence BAtlas). Gsell places it approximately 2 kilometers southeast of the village of \"Medjana\". The location should lie within a kilometer of the BAtlas coordinates: a point west of the modern RN 106 highway between Me\u011fana and Bordj Bou Arreridj in the Algerian wilaya of Bordj Bou Arreridj.",
